            ],
            "fact_ids": [
              "mle.model_release_rollback#f2"
            ],
            "anchors": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Rollback is not ‘use latest’ or remove everything old. The target must retain its approval/version identity, and the faulty test release is not retired before replacement readiness.",
